sequenceDiagram
    participant Bank as Bank/Financial Institution
    participant Plaid as Plaid API
    participant App as Flask Application
    participant DB as Database
    participant Analysis as Data Analysis Services
    participant UI as User Interface

    Bank->>Plaid: Provide transaction data

    Note over App, UI: Initial Sync
    App->>Plaid: Request transactions sync
    Plaid-->>App: Return added transactions
    App->>DB: Store new transactions

    Note over App, UI: Periodic Sync
    App->>Plaid: Sync with cursor
    Plaid-->>App: Return new, modified and removed transactions
    App->>DB: Add new transactions
    App->>DB: Update modified transactions
    App->>DB: Remove deleted transactions

    Note over App, UI: Data Retrieval
    App->>DB: Query transaction data
    DB-->>App: Return transaction records
    App->>Analysis: Process transaction data
    Analysis-->>App: Return processed data and visualizations

    Note over App, UI: Frontend Display
    App->>UI: Send transaction data
    App->>UI: Send spending analyses
    App->>UI: Send visualizations (charts, graphs)
    UI-->>User: Display financial dashboard